@context: Reusable steps. Another hunt imports these by name and runs them with USE.
@title: account_library
@export: LogIn, LogOut
# An imported @var is a default: the importing hunt, a data row or a global
# can override it. {site} has no default, so the importing hunt must set it.
@var: {user} = ada
@var: {password} = lovelace

STEP LogIn:
    NAVIGATE to {site}/login.html
    FILL 'Username' field with '{user}'
    FILL 'Password' field with '{password}'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, {user}' is present

STEP LogOut:
    CLICK the 'Logout' button ON HEADER
    VERIFY that 'Sign in' is present
